{
 "_doc": "Sc\u00e1thach (GAME_DESIGN.md: Heroes; art 10/31/2026). Built by tools/art/build_scathach.py on the shared body in tools/art/hero_kit.py; rules in docs/ART_RULES.md. From Tochmarc Emire (she trains C\u00fa Chulainn in arms at her fortress, D\u00fan Sc\u00e1ith, the fortress of shadows) and Aided \u00d3enfir A\u00edfe. The tales do not describe her looks, so her dress follows early Irish clothing in the same tales (as C\u00fa Chulainn's): a l\u00e9ine (tunic) to the knees, a brat (mantle) over the shoulders held by a ring brooch, a belt, and shoes, in the dark, shadowy colours of her fortress; long dark hair. Fair skin. Not based on any modern version (GAME_DESIGN.md: avoid the Fate/Grand Order design). Her spear is drawn separately (data/art/weapons/) at her hand.",
